# ellr-qbo-timesheet monorepo

**Project language: English** (see `.cursor/rules/language.mdc`).

## Architecture

- `backend/`: Laravel API, sole contact point with QuickBooks Online.
- `packages/api-client/`: shared HTTP client (`@ellr/api-client`), used by admin and timesheet.
- `apps/admin/` and `apps/timesheet/`: React, communicate only with `/api/*` via `@ellr/api-client`.
- DRY/SOLID principles: see `.cursor/rules/dry-solid.mdc` (always active).
- Refactor and reusability plan: `docs/dry-reusability-plan.md`.

## Husky hooks

Format **v9+**: `.husky/pre-commit` and `.husky/pre-push` contain only the npm command (no shebang or `husky.sh`, obsolete before v10).

| Hook | Command | Checks |
|------|---------|--------|
| `pre-commit` | `npm run precommit` | oxlint, Pint, PHPCS, PHPMD, TypeScript |
| `pre-push` | `npm run prepush` | Full lint (deps + jscpd) + typecheck + 85 % coverage + arch + Behat + PHPStan + Pest/Stryker mutation + Vite builds |

Shared IDE config: `.vscode/`, `.editorconfig`, `.nvmrc`, `backend/.php-version` (committed for consistent dev setup).

## Before finishing a task

1. Run relevant checks:
   - `npm run lint`
   - `npm run typecheck` (if TS touched)
   - `npm run test` or `npm run test:coverage` (if application code touched)
   - `cd backend && composer test` (if PHP touched)
2. Do not commit unless Husky hooks pass.
3. Add or update tests for any behavior change.

## Forbidden

- Secrets in code (`.env`, QBO tokens).
- Direct frontend → Intuit/QBO calls.
- Leftover debug `dd()`, `dump()`, `console.log`.
- Bypassing hooks with `--no-verify` unless the user explicitly asks.

## Coverage

| Zone | Threshold |
|------|-----------|
| Backend Pest | 85 % (`composer test:coverage`) |
| Frontend Vitest | 85 % lines/stmts/funcs, 75 % branches |
| `packages/api-client` | 85 % lines/stmts/funcs, 75 % branches |

## Mutation testing

| Zone | Tool | Command | Finance thresholds |
|------|------|---------|-------------------|
| Backend PHP | Pest `--mutate` (Pest 4 native) | `npm run test:mutation:backend` | score ≥ 80 % |
| Frontend TS | [Stryker](https://stryker-mutator.io/) | `npm run test:mutation:frontend` | break ≥ 55 %, low ≥ 65 %, high ≥ 80 % |

`test:mutation:frontend`: admin ~85 %, timesheet ~91 %, api-client ~93 % (low 65 % and high 80 % validated).

## Quality pipelines

| Command | When to use | Includes |
|---------|---------------|----------|
| `npm run precommit` | pre-commit hook | `lint:fast` (oxlint + Pint + PHPCS + PHPMD) + typecheck |
| `npm run prepush` | pre-push hook | full `lint` + `lint:dup:tests` + typecheck + 85 % coverage + arch + Behat + PHPStan + Pest/Stryker mutation + Vite builds |
| `npm run qa` | Quick local check | lint + types + coverage + Behat + builds (**no** arch or PHPStan) |
| `npm run qa:finance` | Standalone finance gates | front/back coverage + Pest mutation + Stryker (subset already in `prepush`; use to rerun without full prepush) |
| `cd backend && composer qa` | Backend only | Pint + PHPCS + PHPStan + coverage + arch + Behat |

```bash
npm run qa
npm run qa:finance       # alias of validate:thresholds
npm run validate:thresholds
```
